      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/eb8c5e/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-03-17T02:54:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi all - new to the game and the site!</p><p>I managed to get the enhanced edition of the game a few weeks ago and have been playing it a bunch, reaching the point where I'd like some expansions. I really wanted to get my hands on Rook city/Infernal relics (the Ennead seem super cool), but everywhere I can find vaguely near me (I'm in New Zealand) it's out of stock. There are a few international places that claim to have it, but including shipping it's getting into triple figures.</p><p>What I was wondering, and can't seem to find anywhere else, does anyone know if Infernal Relics/Rook City is getting reprinted any time soon? If there's going to be more stock in a few months I'll wait and save money, but if it's never going to be printed again I may as well bite the bullet now and pay the exorbitant price before supply drops even further.</p><p>Thanks for your help!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:01.658Z",
