      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-03-17T03:09:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>They said that all the existing games will be reprinted this spring. One of the options in the Kickstarter was \"Everything Ever\", copies of all the existing games, and they are expecting all of those to be available by GenCon in August (including RC/IR).</p><p>They only ordered the reprint during the Kickstarter, I believe, so it will be at least a few months for the game to be printed, shipped to the US, and then shipped out again to distributors.</p>",
